---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Leadership in the AI Era" description="Human-centered perspectives on AI, strategy, leadership, and the future of work.">
<section class="page-hero"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Leadership in the AI Era</p><h1>The future is technological. Leadership must remain human.</h1><p>Artificial intelligence is reshaping how we work, decide, learn, and lead. The essential question is how we bring wisdom, ethics, and purpose into that transformation.</p></div></section>
<section class="paper section"><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">Areas of exploration</p><div class="topics"><article><span>01</span><h2>Ethical AI Leadership</h2><p>Creating systems and decisions grounded in human values and accountability.</p></article><article><span>02</span><h2>Future of Work</h2><p>Helping people and organizations adapt with confidence and care.</p></article><article><span>03</span><h2>Human-Centered Innovation</h2><p>Using technology to strengthen—not replace—human potential.</p></article><article><span>04</span><h2>Strategic Transformation</h2><p>Leading through uncertainty with clarity, resilience, and a long view.</p></article></div></div></section>
<section class="section"><div class="container prompt"><p class="eyebrow">An invitation</p><h2 class="section-title">Let’s build a future worthy of the people who will live in it.</h2><a class="button" href="/speaking">Bring this conversation to your organization</a></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
<style>.page-hero{padding:11rem 0 5rem;background:linear-gradient(125deg,#15271b,#111 62%)}h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,6vw,5.8rem);max-width:1000px;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:.7rem 0}.page-hero p:not(.eyebrow){color:#d0c9bd;max-width:680px;font-size:1.08rem}.topics{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;margin-top:3rem;border-top:1px solid #d9d1c4;border-left:1px solid #d9d1c4}.topics article{padding:2rem;border-right:1px solid #d9d1c4;border-bottom:1px solid #d9d1c4}.topics span{color:#916f30;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.1em}.topics h2{font-size:1.9rem;margin:1.5rem 0 .5rem}.topics p{color:#5a554c}.prompt{text-align:center}.prompt h2{margin:1rem auto 2rem}@media(max-width:600px){.topics{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
